    (
    %code sm
    576px,
    %code md
    768px,
    %code lg
    992px,
    %code xl
    1200px,
    %code xxl
    1400px).
    Without a breakpoint (
    %code> col-6
    ), the width applies at
    %strong all
    viewport sizes.
